WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.740
Tonight is the evening of Valentine's Day.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.510
Putting the feelings I've kept to myself...

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.880
...into sweet chocolates...

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.950
I swear my love.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.450
We can see each other whenever we want to, but...

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:29.620
We're too close to exchange whispers of love.

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:32.360
But I'll say it!

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:37.200
I love you.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.600
I'm not letting any of you have her!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.270
That's who we are--siblings.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.040
<i>Can't stop loving!</i>

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.310
<i>I love you 24/7!</i>

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.280
<i>You're my sweet heaven♂♀</i>

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.920
<i>Into you all year round!</i>

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.080
<i>Are you gonna be my girl!!</i>

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>Make the first move for the win!</i>
<i>Situation still unclear</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:13.600
<i>Every day is full of love wars (Trouble love)</i>

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.600
"Watch for Pitfall Traps"

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>And here's the arrival of the rivals</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:24.080
<i>Moving in fast, the strands</i> <i>of love get super-duper tangled</i>

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:23.910
"Do Not Stop"

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.580
<i>More than anyone ever (Believe my eyes)</i>

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.120
<i>I'll cherish you (True my heart)</i>

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:34.590
<i>Wrapping you up...</i>

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:39.490
<i>Sweeter than a kiss ✭</i>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.430
<i>Every day! Every night!</i>

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.700
<i>I'll be there for all seasons!</i>

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.630
<i>What a wonderful world</i>

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.870
<i>The days we've spent are all anniversaries</i>

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.840
<i>Can't stop loving!</i>

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>I want to protect your smile!</i>

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.010
<i>You're my sweet heaven♂♀</i>

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.150
<i>Transcending destiny</i>

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:01.640
<i>Are you gonna be my girl!!</i>

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.320
"Siblings Excluded!"

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:13.920
"Watch for Squirrels"

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.030
"Tues \ Weds \ (Thurs) 14 \ Fri \ Sat"

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.740
Tomorrow's date has been circled, but...

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.810
Does someone have some special plans?

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:29.380
Oh, tomorrow's Valentine's Day, right?

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.850
Which means, maybe someone circled it

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:36.480
to make sure she doesn't forget to get them chocolate.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.060
I just got back.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.910
What's going on?
What's up, you pervy siblings?

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:02.040
Um, has something happened?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.750
Choco... late...

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:11.890
I swear. Here, I was wondering what it was and it was about chocolate!

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:14.720
Getting all excited, just because it's Valentine's Day!

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:18.760
Maybe it's an important day for men.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.420
I'm sure they're all popular, so I bet they get lots of chocolates.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.100
Talk about a sense of entitlement.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:36.710
I wonder if Big Sis will give me chocolate.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:38.450
She probably will.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.450
Just-to-be-nice chocolate.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.280
What?! I don't want just-to-be-nice chocolate!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:47.090
It can't be helped.
Because we're her siblings, after all.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:48.320
Sheesh!

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:50.820
Tsubaki, no being mean to your little brother.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.930
I still don't want just-to-be-nice chocolate!

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.070
In that case, I'm getting her reverse-chocolate!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.270
Reverse-chocolate?

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.830
You don't know?

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:00.770
Lately,

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:03.100
it's gotten popular for the guy to give chocolate expressing his love,

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.670
called reverse-chocolate.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:06.840
Huh.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.480
I'm going to make chocolate to give Big Sis!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.510
For real?!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:16.480
Then, I'll also... make chocolate... for Chii.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.790
You, too, Louis?!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:22.360
Well, she will probably like that, in part because it will be a nice surprise.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.760
Then maybe I'll give her some, too.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:27.660
It'll also be a way for me to declare my intentions.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.360
You'll make some, too, right, Azusa?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:33.130
Yeah, if you're going to, then...

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:35.370
Th-Then, me, too.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.630
What?

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.780
Oh, Iorin!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:46.050
We were just talking together about making chocolate for Big Sis!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.780
Not exactly together,

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.850
but more like each of us making something for her.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.150
I see. I have something I need to do, so...

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.630
I'm going to borrow this.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.400
He's never game for anything.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.880
You're all here together...

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.050
These bastards have that intense look in their eyes again today.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.210
I-Is something the matter?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.890
With how things are,
I feel bad about not saying anything,

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:26.750
so let us tell her.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:27.760
All right.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.860
We're making reverse-chocolates!

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.490
Reverse-chocolates?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.100
To give to me?

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.270
After all, today <i>is</i> Valentine's Day.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.600
But I've always thought that Valentine's Day

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:43.570
is when women give to men.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.570
Chii.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.680
Having feelings that they want to convey to someone

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.110
is the same for both men and women.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:54.920
We're going to make our chocolates now, so please accept them.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.680
Even you, Subaru?

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.290
I know!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.690
Each of us will be making our own chocolate,

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.190
but I'd like you to make it so you only accept one.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:03.890
What?

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:04.960
Tsubaki!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.060
Me, too!

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:08.260
I want you to eat <i>only</i> my chocolate!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.030
Wataru...

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:13.230
Hmm, if that is the deal,

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.940
then I really cannot refrain from making some.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.570
Ukyo...

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.570
I'll work hard, too.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.440
Subaru...

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.440
Louis...

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:27.820
I'll make it... so you'll choose mine.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.220
--What?
--Huh?

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:37.260
Um...

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.960
Chii, where are you going?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:49.740
I thought maybe I'd go for a little walk.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.240
I feel kind of strange being in the living room.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:55.240
The mood was definitely tense in there.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:56.340
I swear!

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.980
Do you want to come with me, Juli?

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.970
No, there's no knowing what they'll do if I let them out of my sight.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.690
Then...

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.160
Okay.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.820
Hup.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:27.100
What... is this guy doing?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.290
Considering that this competition is set in the kitchen,

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.720
I cannot allow myself to be defeated.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:50.730
This is pretty hard.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:53.400
Azusa, I got some on my hand.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.000
Lick it, lick it.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.330
Honestly...

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.240
What should I make?!

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:09.050
I know.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.090
Chii's favorite...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.690
That's what I'll make.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.720
My chocolate is the best!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.830
Oh! What should I do?!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:23.490
They don't even know how Chii feels.
The bothersome bastards.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.300
I knew it.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.290
I thought you'd pick my chocolate.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.260
Tsubaki...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.040
Really, thank you for choosing me.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.140
I hope you'll eat this.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:10.270
Is this... you?

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:18.590
But to eat chocolate shaped like you...

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.320
I'd feel bad and I couldn't do it.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.460
Oh, right...

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.230
I'm sorry I didn't think that far ahead.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.820
I'll put this chocolate on display in my room.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:34.470
But then, my feelings...

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.990
...won't get across to you, so...

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.680
Eat <i>me</i>!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.940
What?

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:00.760
Huh?

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:04.000
I can pretty much guess what you're fantasizing about,

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.800
but would you mind not seeing her in me?

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:11.710
If you want to be chosen, you'd better not stop working.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.840
I hear chocolate stops being tasty if you don't melt it properly.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.510
Or more like, why do you give chocolate to profess your love?

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.120
To begin with, since the dawn of history,

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.890
chocolate has been one of the iconic aphrodisiacs.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:30.120
The Native Americans mixed chili peppers and such into cocoa powder,

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:35.200
and dissolved it in hot or cold water to use as medicines or tonics.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:38.030
That was then brought over to Europe by Columbus

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:43.040
and became the chocolate we know today with milk and sugar.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.010
And scientifically speaking, chocolate contains a type of phenethylamine,

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:52.150
a neurotransmitter in the brain which is the source of romantic feelings.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.340
It is a proven fact!

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:01.750
--Turn out tasty! Turn out tasty!
Turn out tasty! Turn out tasty! Turn out...

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:01.750
--Not listening, I see.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:13.900
This guy... Seriously, what is he doing?

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:30.440
Such a nice aroma.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.220
What do you think?

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:36.550
My specially made chocolate bathing milk.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.430
It feels really nice.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.640
It was cold outside, wasn't it?

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.040
You can warm up in this chocolate bath.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.940
I-I will.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.580
But me?

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:58.450
You've long since had me...

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:00.470
...at a fever pitch.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.820
You're having naughty thoughts, aren't you?

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.560
N-Not really...

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:31.250
Choose just one chocolate?

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.350
That's hard.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.850
I'm not really keen on going to see everybody.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.090
There is no need for you to go!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:42.960
But they're going to all that trouble just to make chocolate for me, so...

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.200
These are...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.800
I tried making some chocolate brandy truffles.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.860
I am not sure if they are to your taste...

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.010
It's very delicious.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:00.940
You really are so skillful...

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:09.220
Are you all right?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:14.190
I'm so sorry. I felt kind of dizzy and...

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.630
It seems I inadvertently put too much brandy in.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:21.330
And to have done so when you are still underage...

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.560
As someone who practices the law as his occupation,

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:26.200
it is a most unbecoming mistake.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:31.540
Oh! Please pass judgment upon me to the fullest extent of the law!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.540
Or perhaps...

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.850
Can the two of us claim extraterritoriality tonight?

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:40.340
Ukyo...

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.760
This is so unlike me. Such a foolish fantasy.

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.820
You're putting in that much alcohol?

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:06.270
Whoa, this stinks of alcohol!

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:10.380
Hey, what are you going to do after this?

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:13.280
I know! If everyone messes up and can't give her any chocolates,

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.580
it'll save Chii the trouble, too!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.610
I wonder if it's set...

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.930
For a bathing milk, maybe I should make it a bit thinner...

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.760
Oh, good heavens!

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.740
Oh! My chocolate!

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:37.440
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:40.530
Hot! Hot! Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.560
All right, I've got it.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.930
Huh?

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.260
What's with all of you?

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:09.960
I'll convey my feelings with my chocolates.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.680
Done.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.240
At this rate, Subaru will win by default.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.510
Pass!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:32.030
Subaru, is this... chocolate?

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:35.700
Yeah, I made it thinking of you.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:39.200
With that ball, I'm aiming for your heart...

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.600
...to make a 3-point shot.

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.000
Subaru...

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:14.670
I'm back.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:25.210
Th-Th-This is...

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:28.750
...a shot at your 3-point heart...

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.850
The chocolate's a b-ball...

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:32.420
What?

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:33.550
Oh...

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.390
This is...

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.730
...a cute...

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.660
...Western pear, isn't it?

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:40.860
What?

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:44.770
No, it's not... a Western pear...

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.870
Or rather...

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:46.770
Unfortunately,

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:51.340
it seems no one, except me, was able to finish making their chocolates.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.840
So please accept this chocolate!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.430
I see...

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.590
I'd say your palms are way too hot.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:09.190
Got too nervous there.

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.930
Wh-Why?!

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:16.260
In the end, no one was able to make their reverse-chocolate.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.370
I have a present for you.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.100
Do not tell me that it is chocolate...?

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.200
To think that he was making it in hiding.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.270
Hey, now, you were sneaking around to get ahead?

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.430
No fair, Iorin!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.280
Please accept it.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:32.970
Oh, thank you very much.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.660
Thanks for the treat.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.060
It was delicious.

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:50.760
Now, what shall we do for dinner?

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:53.070
I'm still not hungry.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.300
Sorry about this, Chii.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.470
S-Sure...

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.070
This isn't exactly to make up for that, but...

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:02.310
I have chocolate to give you.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.750
I don't know if they taste good,

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.850
but they're all the same.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:14.580
Because to me, all of you are family, who are dear to me in the same way.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.470
Thank you very much.

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:27.870
Chii, thank you.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.870
Big Sis, I'll eat them with care!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.510
It seems like kind of a shame to eat them.

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.340
I'm happy to receive it.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.610
It looks good.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:40.180
I'll be sure to eat it.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.310
All right.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.450
So, in the end, we all got just-to-be-nice chocolates.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.120
But you're happy, right?

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.390
I guess.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.530
Come to think of it, yesterday,

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.660
Big Sis had one that looked like the main-squeeze chocolate.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.230
It's true...

00:18:57.230 --> 00:19:03.070
Chii had just one... special one... with her.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.870
I wonder who in the world that chocolate was for.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.640
Is there someone that she has feelings for?

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:10.510
You mean, separate from the ones we just got,

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:13.170
she's got another one for one of us?

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.490
Not happening.

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:21.390
That one is mine, of course.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:25.030
Oh, right. If it's for Juli...

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.590
Oh, so it's for this rat?

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:29.360
Then, that is fine.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.200
Yup.

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.390
Yeah.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.940
Juli, I'm sorry.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.070
I forgot to give you yours.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.840
Here.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.940
Happy Valentine's Day.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.790
This...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.560
...does not even appear to be chocolate...

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:59.760
Juli...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.960
Then, that chocolate...

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.360
What is the matter, everyone?

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:25.110
"To my beloved dad"

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.320
<i>I can't hear the "I love you"</i>

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:34.460
<i>Why? Why do you end up looking down?</i>

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:37.630
<i>Tired from the excitement, you sleep</i>

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:41.170
<i>Your breathing soft and gentle</i>

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:47.770
<i>I'll stay right here and</i> <i>keep my gaze fixed on you</i>

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:51.180
<i>I shouldn't wake you up, right?</i>

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.580
<i>I feel an urge to touch you</i>

00:20:54.580 --> 00:21:01.420
<i>It's because your lips are way too defenseless!</i>

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:08.130
<i>Who are you with in your dream?</i>
<i>(What are you doing?)</i>

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:15.040
<i>I feel as though the jealousy will burn me</i>
<i>(Could it be that you're with those guys?)</i>

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.340
<i>Into that place</i>
<i>(Softly, quietly)</i>

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:21.710
<i>I want to sneak in</i>
<i>(It's okay, right?)</i>

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:27.480
<i>Even in a dream, I don't want</i> <i>to let anyone else have you</i>

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:31.790
<i>I'll shout, "I love you, I love you,"</i> <i>as many times as it takes</i>

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:35.160
<i>I want all of you</i>

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:41.900
<i>Only stolen kisses?</i>
<i>Wrong! Wrong! That's not love</i>

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.330
<i>No matter how tightly I hold you</i>

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:48.740
<i>No matter how passionately I gaze at you</i>

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.400
<i>I can't hear the "I love you"</i>

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:55.170
<i>Why do you always end up looking down?</i>
